      "text": "30 feet. Living creatures are Frightened 1 while in Equendia's great despair aura. They can't naturally recover from this fear while in the area but recover instantly once they leave it. When a creature first enters the area, it must succeed at a DC 27 Will save save (after taking the penalty from being frightened) or be Paralyzed for 1d4 rounds. The creature is then temporarily immune for 24 hours.\n\nEffect: Despair",
